@startuml
' ARCHIVED / SUPERSEDED: historical research, not the current UI contract.
' Source 883b6d3a47f7113e44ede73c9ad16b40f15bbdaf:docs/project_management/change_plans/ui-chart-wheel/developer/sequence_diagrams/ui/002-acceptance-selection-focus.puml
' DRAFT Developer TASK-D-005. InputSHA34f187a; AnalystContractSHA2736e28 (accepted v3+S1).
' R001-04; A005 applied; A006 conditional. REQ-WHEEL-04/07/08/10; AS-WHEEL-28/29/30.
title DRAFT v2: full accepted DTO index before filters, once cause and live focus
autonumber
hide footbox
actor User
participant "Session accept owner" as Session
control "ResultController" as Result
participant "Full accepted DTO index" as Index
participant "Retained HTML/SVG controls" as DOM
User -> Session : explicit submit immutable B; attemptId
Session -> Session : draft can change independently
Session -> Result : accepted DTO + unique acceptanceSeq + cause
Result -> Index : all source rows, unordered endpoints + published type
Index -> Index : cardinality BEFORE category/five-all/planet-filter
Index --> Result : rows/order/from-to/category/orb unchanged; 0/1/>1 matches
alt own committed changed-birth OR active pending-goal fresh matched recovery (A005)
  Result -> Result : apply reset once per accepted attempt/event
  Result -> DOM : selection none, five/five
  opt current draft equals submitted snapshot
    opt focused field will be hidden
      Result -> DOM : focus existing live Edit without scroll BEFORE hide
    end
    Result -> DOM : collapse fields; recovery controls remain outside
  end
else automatic current / reconcile
  alt selected key has exactly one match
    Result -> DOM : retain same key, update NEW facts/direction/category/orb
  else selected aspect has >1 accepted source matches (S1)
    Result -> DOM : clear only aspect; restore prior general five/all, not planet filter
    Result -> DOM : preserve houses/draft; all original HTML rows + local accessible warning
    Result -> DOM : no affected line/conjunction/aspect-select; unaffected point/pairs continue
  else absent selected key
    Result -> DOM : clear only missing selection, preserve expansion/draft
  end
else target_confirmed_already_applied
  note over Session, Result
  Separate TASK-A-006 / R001-05; apply only published owner policy when available.
  No invented default or producer-provenance claim; geometry independent.
  end note
end
Session -> Result : failed/rejected read or repeated phase/publish
Result -> Result : no new full index from unaccepted data; no repeated reset
note over Index, DOM
Unique reverse / different type / other pairs and present point are unaffected.
Background unique keeps two endpoints, not an old line.
After accepted ambiguity, later unique enables selection, never auto-reselects.
F5 runtime NOT RUN in D005; these are accepted contract design invariants.
end note
User -> DOM : native point/unique-row Enter, Space, pointer
DOM -> Result : canonical intent, live current capability
Result -> DOM : keyed patch, SAME connected control, preserve tab order
note over Result, DOM
Planet activation: no programmatic focus/scroll.
Same-key recreation is not retention.
External accepted recreation may restore live permitted key without scroll;
removed/disabled key follows existing H5 cause-specific live fallback.
end note
@enduml
